WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.374 --> 00:00:03.291
Unit fifteen. Alcohol Risks!

2
00:00:04.241 --> 00:00:07.958
Hello, everyone! I'm Nurse Bopha, your school nurse.

3
00:00:08.008 --> 00:00:11.313
Hi, Nurse Bopha! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:11.363 --> 00:00:14.962
Today we learn about Alcohol Risks. Let's go!

5
00:00:16.093 --> 00:00:19.960
Alcohol. Say it with me. Alcohol!

6
00:00:23.408 --> 00:00:26.675
Brain. Say it with me. Brain!

7
00:00:30.192 --> 00:00:33.592
Liver. Say it with me. Liver!

8
00:00:37.096 --> 00:00:40.396
Risk. Say it with me. Risk!

9
00:00:43.897 --> 00:00:47.630
Accident. Say it with me. Accident!

10
00:00:51.123 --> 00:00:54.889
Peer pressure. Say it with me. Peer pressure!

11
00:00:58.389 --> 00:01:02.205
Refuse. Say it with me. Refuse!

12
00:01:05.721 --> 00:01:08.754
Law. Say it with me. Law!

13
00:01:12.254 --> 00:01:22.419
Alcohol harms the brain and liver and increases the risk of an accident. Peer pressure can make it hard to say no. I can refuse and follow the law.

14
00:01:22.469 --> 00:01:23.908
I can do that too!

15
00:01:25.478 --> 00:01:30.546
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:30.596 --> 00:01:31.746
Liver!

17
00:01:32.436 --> 00:01:37.551
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:37.601 --> 00:01:38.751
Refuse!

19
00:01:39.738 --> 00:01:46.330
Did you know? Most countries have a minimum legal age for buying alcohol to protect young people!

20
00:01:46.380 --> 00:01:48.394
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:49.069 --> 00:01:56.904
Think and answer. What could you say to refuse alcohol at a party?

22
00:01:56.954 --> 00:01:58.104
Great answer!

23
00:01:59.211 --> 00:02:04.105
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:04.155 --> 00:02:06.920
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

